Album upload notifications on the wall were reported to render preview images in a column instead of side-by-side. Investigation confirmed `.post-album-thumbs` already has the correct layout:

```css
.post-album-thumbs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
}
```

The issue was a stale browser cache serving an older version of `style.css`. A hard reload resolved it — no code changes required.

