- `@hevcjs/core`: typed `HEVCDecoder` class with `.create()` / `.decode()` / `.destroy()` API, Web Worker, typed frame/stream types
- `@hevcjs/videojs`: `HevcWasmTech` Video.js Tech, `FMP4Demuxer` (moof/mdat → NAL units), `FrameRenderer` (VideoFrame/MediaStreamTrackGenerator + WebGL fallback)
- Root `package.json` with npm subpath exports: `import { HEVCDecoder } from 'hevc.js'` and `import 'hevc.js/videojs'`
- tsup build (ESM + .d.ts), TypeScript strict mode
